(764850, 82970, 21362, '<td valign="top">Haha, this is so similar to a shot I took for this challenge - only difference were my hand was on the right, and my coin was a US quarter that left a movement blur.  I would''ve entered it but the time/date was accidently reset so it couldn''t be verified if necessary. I''ll be following this to see how it does. Naturally, I think it''s brilliant!</td>', 'Haha, this is so similar to a shot I took for this challenge - only difference were my hand was on the right, and my coin was a US quarter that left a movement blur.  I would''ve entered it but the time/date was accidently reset so it couldn''t be verified if necessary. I''ll be following this to see how it does. Naturally, I think it''s brilliant!', '2004-06-16 01:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(764851, 82820, 975, '<td valign="top">Very nice, scary, but nice!  Love the green background, but the log (rock?) in the foreground would be nicer if it were a little sharper.  You''re braver than most of us.</td>', 'Very nice, scary, but nice!  Love the green background, but the log (rock?) in the foreground would be nicer if it were a little sharper.  You''re braver than most of us.', '2004-06-16 01:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
