(764863, 84036, 10055, '<td valign="top">Awlsome perspective!!!!! Great job you both did here! Wonderfully made...I just cracked up and nearly fell on the floor laughing....It was a funny as I thought of what a baby might be chooseing to feel or do...or think how crazy adults are with funny faces and thinking that''s strange....this is a fun photo....good luck...also, the comp. is well done...perfect!!! 10</td>', 'Awlsome perspective!!!!! Great job you both did here! Wonderfully made...I just cracked up and nearly fell on the floor laughing....It was a funny as I thought of what a baby might be chooseing to feel or do...or think how crazy adults are with funny faces and thinking that''s strange....this is a fun photo....good luck...also, the comp. is well done...perfect!!! 10', '2004-06-16 01:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
