(767265, 83936, 16004, '<td valign="top">is this totally feeble or absolute genius?  not entirely sure, perhaps a bit of both.  i''m also not entirely sure that this fits the challenge - isn''t the selection actually pre-determined following certain grammatical laws?  Is using "grammatical" grammatically correct?  who knows!?  technically, it''s ok - the shallow DOF works well on the key, but the colon is a bit out of focus.  slightly higher aperture might have brought more of the important key in focus.  notwithstanding it''s technical attributes, it''s still (unfortunately) a bit of an uninspiring shot (as is most stuff beige and plastic).  i think voters on the whole would penalise any shot of this nature no matter the quality of the shot, so it''s always best to step outdoors and to at least pretend you have made a bigger effort.   i do like it for some reason though - don''t know if it''s the graininess, style, overall silliness or what...  5.</td>', 'is this totally feeble or absolute genius?  not entirely sure, perhaps a bit of both.  i''m also not entirely sure that this fits the challenge - isn''t the selection actually pre-determined following certain grammatical laws?  Is using "grammatical" grammatically correct?  who knows!?  technically, it''s ok - the shallow DOF works well on the key, but the colon is a bit out of focus.  slightly higher aperture might have brought more of the important key in focus.  notwithstanding it''s technical attributes, it''s still (unfortunately) a bit of an uninspiring shot (as is most stuff beige and plastic).  i think voters on the whole would penalise any shot of this nature no matter the quality of the shot, so it''s always best to step outdoors and to at least pretend you have made a bigger effort.   i do like it for some reason though - don''t know if it''s the graininess, style, overall silliness or what...  5.', '2004-06-17 05:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(767293, 83524, 14863, '<td valign="top">Cool idea- I like the simplicity. BUt the yes &amp; no are all blurry-like, sadness...If you really focused on one or the other  it''d be awesome- but t his is really good- congrats! 7</td>', 'Cool idea- I like the simplicity. BUt the yes & no are all blurry-like, sadness...If you really focused on one or the other  it''d be awesome- but t his is really good- congrats! 7', '2004-06-17 06:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
