(767314, 83341, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the textures, good lighting. I don''t think the topic is very universal, though, ''paper or plastic?'' is a typical US question, lots of people won''t get it.</td>', 'Nice capture of the textures, good lighting. I don''t think the topic is very universal, though, ''paper or plastic?'' is a typical US question, lots of people won''t get it.', '2004-06-17 07:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(767326, 82549, 16004, '<td valign="top">though not exactly knowledgeable as far as american politics are concerned, i know about the (weird crazy bizarre) selection of animal mascots each party has (do you know how they original came about) and the manner in which you''ve presented them is excellent.  This is current, relevant and unlike most photos with the stars and stripes, totally not about trumpet-led pride and similar sentiment.  in fact, it''s quite restrained and i love and respect you for that.  it fits the challenge, is very well taken (no tips for improvement from me).  the only time i''ve given a flag-orientated piccy a ten.   i only hope that Martin Sheen gets in for a second term...</td>', 'though not exactly knowledgeable as far as american politics are concerned, i know about the (weird crazy bizarre) selection of animal mascots each party has (do you know how they original came about) and the manner in which you''ve presented them is excellent.  This is current, relevant and unlike most photos with the stars and stripes, totally not about trumpet-led pride and similar sentiment.  in fact, it''s quite restrained and i love and respect you for that.  it fits the challenge, is very well taken (no tips for improvement from me).  the only time i''ve given a flag-orientated piccy a ten.   i only hope that Martin Sheen gets in for a second term...', '2004-06-17 08:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(767344, 82550, 20960, '<td valign="top">I LOVE THIS PHOTO - EXCELLENT</td>', 'I LOVE THIS PHOTO - EXCELLENT', '2004-06-17 08:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(767356, 83920, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice clear, sharp photo</td>', 'nice clear, sharp photo', '2004-06-17 09:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(767359, 83824, 16241, '<td valign="top">colorful character............</td>', 'colorful character............', '2004-06-17 09:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(767394, 83773, 9747, '<td valign="top">Love this one, it''s cute! The dog''s head being tilted a bit (ears not evenly lined up) may be somewhat distracting, but not too bad at all. Am wondering how you got the dog to stay so still for this shot! ;-) Excellent composition and lighting. Great picture, fits the theme purr-fectly!</td>', 'Love this one, it''s cute! The dog''s head being tilted a bit (ears not evenly lined up) may be somewhat distracting, but not too bad at all. Am wondering how you got the dog to stay so still for this shot! ;-) Excellent composition and lighting. Great picture, fits the theme purr-fectly!', '2004-06-17 10:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(767395, 83974, 16241, '<td valign="top">good contrast</td>', 'good contrast', '2004-06-17 10:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(767396, 83973, 15029, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the fear of going mad, but I don''t see choices.<br/> <br/>Edit: Ok, I get it now.  I think it would have helped to have it say "lens choices" or somthing to be more blunt for those who don''t get it.</td>', 'I like the idea of the fear of going mad, but I don''t see choices. Edit: Ok, I get it now.  I think it would have helped to have it say "lens choices" or somthing to be more blunt for those who don''t get it.', '2004-06-17 10:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(767397, 83357, 16241, '<td valign="top">to choose a shirt or make the bed?  lol</td>', 'to choose a shirt or make the bed?  lol', '2004-06-17 10:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(767399, 83371, 16004, '<td valign="top">wow - good humour AND an excellent photo.  ignoring the high chuckle factor for a moment, i find myself deeply impressed with the image.  the sky has been darkened (i assume) quite spectacularly.  the blue of the cladding and the whiteness of the lettering also visually appeasing.  together sky and building should clash, but they don''t.  being picky, i might have spent a few minutes cloning out the cracked panel above the "o", and i might have selected the white areas to make a bit whiter (they have a slight shade of green in areas).  but those are stupid annoying comments, so 10 it is.</td>', 'wow - good humour AND an excellent photo.  ignoring the high chuckle factor for a moment, i find myself deeply impressed with the image.  the sky has been darkened (i assume) quite spectacularly.  the blue of the cladding and the whiteness of the lettering also visually appeasing.  together sky and building should clash, but they don''t.  being picky, i might have spent a few minutes cloning out the cracked panel above the "o", and i might have selected the white areas to make a bit whiter (they have a slight shade of green in areas).  but those are stupid annoying comments, so 10 it is.', '2004-06-17 10:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(767400, 83381, 16241, '<td valign="top">original, good</td>', 'original, good', '2004-06-17 10:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(767402, 83551, 19841, '<td valign="top">The composition is a little too square on to be interesting, and the hockey stick isn''t obvious.  It''s well exposed, and you have some interesting textures.</td>', 'The composition is a little too square on to be interesting, and the hockey stick isn''t obvious.  It''s well exposed, and you have some interesting textures.', '2004-06-17 10:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(767403, 83566, 9747, '<td valign="top">Without the title, it''s hard to see how the picture fits the theme by itself. However, it''s an excellent concept and an adorable model! Might be better if the busy background was more blurry (shorter DOF) to help concentrate the viewer''s focus on the child and the horse. And the picture is slightly crooked, so it needs to be rotated a bit to the left. Nice shooting!</td>', 'Without the title, it''s hard to see how the picture fits the theme by itself. However, it''s an excellent concept and an adorable model! Might be better if the busy background was more blurry (shorter DOF) to help concentrate the viewer''s focus on the child and the horse. And the picture is slightly crooked, so it needs to be rotated a bit to the left. Nice shooting!', '2004-06-17 10:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(767407, 83208, 9747, '<td valign="top">Picture size too small. While I can see what you''re trying to do, the overall image is too cluttered. Remove a few small items and I think it''ll help improve the composition more. Nice attempt though!</td>', 'Picture size too small. While I can see what you''re trying to do, the overall image is too cluttered. Remove a few small items and I think it''ll help improve the composition more. Nice attempt though!', '2004-06-17 10:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(767409, 83831, 19841, '<td valign="top">This is a case where the cleverness of the photography gets in the way of the message of the image.   It''s really interesting, but it has become a wonderful, abstract, anti-gravity sort of thing, and lost its intended meaning.</td>', 'This is a case where the cleverness of the photography gets in the way of the message of the image.   It''s really interesting, but it has become a wonderful, abstract, anti-gravity sort of thing, and lost its intended meaning.', '2004-06-17 10:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(767416, 83931, 19841, '<td valign="top">You''ve got very flat lighting here. (It''s that flash attached to the camera) and everything is a bit orange.</td>', 'You''ve got very flat lighting here. (It''s that flash attached to the camera) and everything is a bit orange.', '2004-06-17 10:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(767418, 83977, 20214, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2004-06-17 10:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(767419, 84034, 9747, '<td valign="top">Very nice, would make a great "Say No" poster! The empty space on the left kind of threw me off, might be better if the left side gets cropped off or the models are moved to the left (as I think the "school" on the bus adds more flavor to the picture). Good posing by the models. All in all, an excellent photo that fits the theme!</td>', 'Very nice, would make a great "Say No" poster! The empty space on the left kind of threw me off, might be better if the left side gets cropped off or the models are moved to the left (as I think the "school" on the bus adds more flavor to the picture). Good posing by the models. All in all, an excellent photo that fits the theme!', '2004-06-17 10:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(767424, 84062, 19841, '<td valign="top">Clever, but ambiguous.</td>', 'Clever, but ambiguous.', '2004-06-17 11:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(767425, 83196, 9747, '<td valign="top">What''s this got to do with the theme "Choices"? Regardless, it''s a very striking picture and the B&amp;W is great!</td>', 'What''s this got to do with the theme "Choices"? Regardless, it''s a very striking picture and the B&W is great!', '2004-06-17 11:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
