(768001, 83973, 18194, '<td valign="top">You would have to be crazy to use a title like that, sorry I couldn''t resist.  I like they way you have the choices seeming to go on forever off the top.  There seems to have been a little bit of a problem with the resizing on this photo in that some of the number seem much brighter then others right next to them.</td>', 'You would have to be crazy to use a title like that, sorry I couldn''t resist.  I like they way you have the choices seeming to go on forever off the top.  There seems to have been a little bit of a problem with the resizing on this photo in that some of the number seem much brighter then others right next to them.', '2004-06-17 21:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(768002, 83069, 173, '<td valign="top">Great title and photo they really makes the entire concept come together.</td>', 'Great title and photo they really makes the entire concept come together.', '2004-06-17 21:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
