(768020, 82733, 18194, '<td valign="top">A nice photo but I find it just a bit disconcerting to have the knife on the left side.  I know this seems like a nit pick but for me it distracts my attention for the main subject.</td>', 'A nice photo but I find it just a bit disconcerting to have the knife on the left side.  I know this seems like a nit pick but for me it distracts my attention for the main subject.', '2004-06-17 21:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
