(768692, 84018, 19503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Georgeous expressions on the little girls faces, indeed they choose to make some joyful noise, the positive energy reached me too! I love how you filled up the frame with people in that sideways angle and made a bottom-center focal point. Having the girls look up works for a great pose. I give it a 10. GJ</td>', 'Beautiful! Georgeous expressions on the little girls faces, indeed they choose to make some joyful noise, the positive energy reached me too! I love how you filled up the frame with people in that sideways angle and made a bottom-center focal point. Having the girls look up works for a great pose. I give it a 10. GJ', '2004-06-18 14:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
