(768965, 83920, 5728, '<td valign="top">I''ve taken this as my favourite shot for the challenge, mainly because of the quality of the image. I see you have some experience with lighting, and I like the idea, the set up is very good. The only thing that stops me from giving you a 10 here is that the shadows under the numbers 56, 20 and 17 don''t come over naturally enough for me, there is too much magenta and not enough gray/black in them. And the shadows under the 56 contain some irregularities that just don''t fit. (9)</td>', 'I''ve taken this as my favourite shot for the challenge, mainly because of the quality of the image. I see you have some experience with lighting, and I like the idea, the set up is very good. The only thing that stops me from giving you a 10 here is that the shadows under the numbers 56, 20 and 17 don''t come over naturally enough for me, there is too much magenta and not enough gray/black in them. And the shadows under the 56 contain some irregularities that just don''t fit. (9)', '2004-06-18 20:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
