(769105, 83441, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like this shot alot. This is the type of shot i would like to take, the  type i wish I "saw."<br/>But... much like my own shots, something is lacking. Here are my thoughts. First the green mold is awesome and the colors are superb. the grey, the tan and the blue are perfectly saturated. The road and the fence are perfect and your eye is drawn where it needs to go. The sign is nice but it is too powerful in the corner. And the rail on the bottom really stinks.<br/>but hell, that path, the desert, the sky, its  poetry. great great job</td>', 'I like this shot alot. This is the type of shot i would like to take, the  type i wish I "saw."But... much like my own shots, something is lacking. Here are my thoughts. First the green mold is awesome and the colors are superb. the grey, the tan and the blue are perfectly saturated. The road and the fence are perfect and your eye is drawn where it needs to go. The sign is nice but it is too powerful in the corner. And the rail on the bottom really stinks.but hell, that path, the desert, the sky, its  poetry. great great job', '2004-06-18 23:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
