(769140, 83638, 12611, '<td valign="top">I hate to say it but this girl appears to be the type who is much more attractive as a smoker than not. It fits her image, i have met her countless times. French manicure, Bitchy, saucy, overly tanned, brunette, sexy, irreverent, mostly because of the acursed cigarette. She is the prototype. But, Take away the cigarette and she becomes older, tired looking, less assertive and less bitchy and hence less attractive. I am not for smoking, but it fits your model here.</td>', 'I hate to say it but this girl appears to be the type who is much more attractive as a smoker than not. It fits her image, i have met her countless times. French manicure, Bitchy, saucy, overly tanned, brunette, sexy, irreverent, mostly because of the acursed cigarette. She is the prototype. But, Take away the cigarette and she becomes older, tired looking, less assertive and less bitchy and hence less attractive. I am not for smoking, but it fits your model here.', '2004-06-18 23:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
