(770739, 83822, 23104, '<td valign="top">this image really makes one think. it goes beyond the cliche ''which pair of shoes'' type of photograph and really makes you look at all the details... the pregnant girl, posed perfectly off-center, the locked door and notice on the door that show how dangerous it can be to provide a controversial service...black and white certainly fits for this image, as the decision faced by the girl really is black and white, either choosing life, or death for her unborn child. a powerful image, a perfect 10 in my eyes.</td>', 'this image really makes one think. it goes beyond the cliche ''which pair of shoes'' type of photograph and really makes you look at all the details... the pregnant girl, posed perfectly off-center, the locked door and notice on the door that show how dangerous it can be to provide a controversial service...black and white certainly fits for this image, as the decision faced by the girl really is black and white, either choosing life, or death for her unborn child. a powerful image, a perfect 10 in my eyes.', '2004-06-21 03:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(770746, 83371, 23104, '<td valign="top">this image was a pleasant suprise. it''s nice to have something humorous after looking at page after page of shoes, coke cans, and junk food. good angle, and amazing sky. the shadow behind the letters really accentuates them. 10.</td>', 'this image was a pleasant suprise. it''s nice to have something humorous after looking at page after page of shoes, coke cans, and junk food. good angle, and amazing sky. the shadow behind the letters really accentuates them. 10.', '2004-06-21 03:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(770752, 84020, 23104, '<td valign="top">i saw the title and groaned. not Another picture of two paths.... but then it loaded and i laughed, what a nice play on words, the image is a little fuzzy, but hey...it made me laugh. and a picture that makes you feel emotion of any sort&lt;besides boredom&gt; is the best kind.</td>', 'i saw the title and groaned. not Another picture of two paths.... but then it loaded and i laughed, what a nice play on words, the image is a little fuzzy, but hey...it made me laugh. and a picture that makes you feel emotion of any sort<besides boredom> is the best kind.', '2004-06-21 03:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(770762, 83650, 23104, '<td valign="top">nice tones, i think the sepia works well for this image. the boy seems very focused on what he is writing....looks like in the back of a yearbook....what to write, it certainly fits the contest. i like that it doesnt look posed at all, as it probably wasn''t. good job</td>', 'nice tones, i think the sepia works well for this image. the boy seems very focused on what he is writing....looks like in the back of a yearbook....what to write, it certainly fits the contest. i like that it doesnt look posed at all, as it probably wasn''t. good job', '2004-06-21 03:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
