(770858, 83357, 23104, '<td valign="top">this photograph was somehow different from all the other clothing/shoe/cliche things photos. it looked real....but had a well composed feel to it. it sure looks like something id throw out on my bed, not a set up shot. the colors contrast well with each other, and the shadows and wrinkles are good. this picture could even be read into more than just what shirt to wear, but also...look at that nice comfy bed, why put on one of these shirts when i can climb back in bed.</td>', 'this photograph was somehow different from all the other clothing/shoe/cliche things photos. it looked real....but had a well composed feel to it. it sure looks like something id throw out on my bed, not a set up shot. the colors contrast well with each other, and the shadows and wrinkles are good. this picture could even be read into more than just what shirt to wear, but also...look at that nice comfy bed, why put on one of these shirts when i can climb back in bed.', '2004-06-21 04:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
