(770995, 83968, 10268, '<td valign="top">I would like for depth of field, personally.  But I do like this quite a bit.  Almost seems surreal. 6.</td>', 'I would like for depth of field, personally.  But I do like this quite a bit.  Almost seems surreal. 6.', '2004-06-21 05:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
