(770999, 84014, 23300, '<td valign="top">The choice to use black and white for this photo creates a sombre and somewhat detached atmosphere. The elongated shape of the image helps to push a sense of vertigo. I really like the dark space below the figure and the highlights on his shoulders. The models pose looks like he is tired of trying to make a decision. I also love the way the angles of the bridge push the sense height and harshness while the models posture suggests a sense of submission. I like this photo the more I look at it.</td>', 'The choice to use black and white for this photo creates a sombre and somewhat detached atmosphere. The elongated shape of the image helps to push a sense of vertigo. I really like the dark space below the figure and the highlights on his shoulders. The models pose looks like he is tired of trying to make a decision. I also love the way the angles of the bridge push the sense height and harshness while the models posture suggests a sense of submission. I like this photo the more I look at it.', '2004-06-21 06:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(771000, 83185, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the way the choices look so big. It portrays a sense of what a young one might be presented with as opposed to an adult. Everything looks so big that the choice becomes a bit overwhelming.</td>', 'I like the way the choices look so big. It portrays a sense of what a young one might be presented with as opposed to an adult. Everything looks so big that the choice becomes a bit overwhelming.', '2004-06-21 06:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(771001, 84030, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the better versions of the junk food versus fruit photos. The matching colours between the fruit and the packet work really well and th black background makes the whole presentation very stark. The overall effect is of a very stark choice. I really like the impact this piece makes. No beating around the bush.</td>', 'I think this is one of the better versions of the junk food versus fruit photos. The matching colours between the fruit and the packet work really well and th black background makes the whole presentation very stark. The overall effect is of a very stark choice. I really like the impact this piece makes. No beating around the bush.', '2004-06-21 06:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(771004, 83874, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think this shot is quite interesting in that the baby in the window becomes the subject. It becomes the subject almost by default due to the fact that it does not appear on the right of the picture. The symetry is quite powerfull being split by the pole in the middle. The asymetry emphasized by the baby really conjurs the sense of possibilities in choices. The image seems a little overexposed although this does add to the starkness of the cityscape.</td>', 'I think this shot is quite interesting in that the baby in the window becomes the subject. It becomes the subject almost by default due to the fact that it does not appear on the right of the picture. The symetry is quite powerfull being split by the pole in the middle. The asymetry emphasized by the baby really conjurs the sense of possibilities in choices. The image seems a little overexposed although this does add to the starkness of the cityscape.', '2004-06-21 06:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(771006, 83822, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the way the starkness of the sign really jumps out of the image. This is quite a confronting composition that doesn''t lose track of the vulnerability and humanity of the subject. I think the isolation and vulnerability of the subject creates an emotional depth that  transcends the impersonality the debate.</td>', 'I love the way the starkness of the sign really jumps out of the image. This is quite a confronting composition that doesn''t lose track of the vulnerability and humanity of the subject. I think the isolation and vulnerability of the subject creates an emotional depth that  transcends the impersonality the debate.', '2004-06-21 06:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(771007, 83968, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like the way this image portrays the overwhelming choices like a highway running away from the viewer. The colours of the remote control really generate a techno type feel. There seem to be little bits of dust or stains on the RC that can be distracting and detract from the main impact. I don''t know how the blue ''flare'' was created but it adds to the techno feel.</td>', 'I really like the way this image portrays the overwhelming choices like a highway running away from the viewer. The colours of the remote control really generate a techno type feel. There seem to be little bits of dust or stains on the RC that can be distracting and detract from the main impact. I don''t know how the blue ''flare'' was created but it adds to the techno feel.', '2004-06-21 06:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(771009, 84062, 20407, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, my favourite for the challenge</td>', 'This is lovely, my favourite for the challenge', '2004-06-21 06:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(771012, 83906, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the way this image presents a very important and potentially dangerous subject in such a visually beautiful way. The composition is just sheer joy, from the soft curves and colours in the top left to the harsh angles and metallic tones in the centre. The shadows even enhance the "scattered" effect. Also the texture on the background is just perfect.</td>', 'I love the way this image presents a very important and potentially dangerous subject in such a visually beautiful way. The composition is just sheer joy, from the soft curves and colours in the top left to the harsh angles and metallic tones in the centre. The shadows even enhance the "scattered" effect. Also the texture on the background is just perfect.', '2004-06-21 06:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(771016, 82696, 23300, '<td valign="top">I''m really struck b the sense of smell that this image generates. The simplicity is quite striking. The various textures are almost touchable.</td>', 'I''m really struck b the sense of smell that this image generates. The simplicity is quite striking. The various textures are almost touchable.', '2004-06-21 06:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(771025, 84034, 23300, '<td valign="top">The choice of black and white works so well in this picture. The dark presence of the central figure really sets the tone. The horitontal lines of the bus and the wide cropping of the image create a sense of movement or inevietability which is quite compelling.</td>', 'The choice of black and white works so well in this picture. The dark presence of the central figure really sets the tone. The horitontal lines of the bus and the wide cropping of the image create a sense of movement or inevietability which is quite compelling.', '2004-06-21 06:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(771027, 83069, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the balance created in the composition. The colour gives a real old world feel and the transparent hands are perfect. What a beautifully constructed image.</td>', 'I love the balance created in the composition. The colour gives a real old world feel and the transparent hands are perfect. What a beautifully constructed image.', '2004-06-21 06:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(771029, 83888, 23300, '<td valign="top">The simplicty of the card compared to the pile of cash is quite dramatic.</td>', 'The simplicty of the card compared to the pile of cash is quite dramatic.', '2004-06-21 06:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(771031, 84001, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. The textures, the colours, the composition. It takes the theme and displays it at its simplest abstract level. Beautiful.</td>', 'I love this picture. The textures, the colours, the composition. It takes the theme and displays it at its simplest abstract level. Beautiful.', '2004-06-21 07:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(771040, 83909, 23300, '<td valign="top">The tones of this image create a sense of serenity and simplicty. I love the sense of sobriety this image creates. The composition, like a set of stairs leading off into the unknown, leaves a sense of incompleteness and further questioning.</td>', 'The tones of this image create a sense of serenity and simplicty. I love the sense of sobriety this image creates. The composition, like a set of stairs leading off into the unknown, leaves a sense of incompleteness and further questioning.', '2004-06-21 07:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(771042, 84028, 23300, '<td valign="top">How many times have I rolled over and half opened one eye to see this. I love the idea of this composition. Its quite immediate and compelling. Its simplicity is so elegant.</td>', 'How many times have I rolled over and half opened one eye to see this. I love the idea of this composition. Its quite immediate and compelling. Its simplicity is so elegant.', '2004-06-21 07:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(771045, 83371, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image creates such a great impact. The colours of the sky are truly beautiful and work perfectly with the colours in the building. The angles and shadows generate a great monolithic impression.</td>', 'This image creates such a great impact. The colours of the sky are truly beautiful and work perfectly with the colours in the building. The angles and shadows generate a great monolithic impression.', '2004-06-21 07:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(771048, 84036, 23300, '<td valign="top">The point of view of this image is really compelling. It makes me wonder what babies make of all the attention they get. I love the colour and light of this picture. The composition, being pushed toward the top, really helps to create the sense that the people are looming over the baby.</td>', 'The point of view of this image is really compelling. It makes me wonder what babies make of all the attention they get. I love the colour and light of this picture. The composition, being pushed toward the top, really helps to create the sense that the people are looming over the baby.', '2004-06-21 07:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(771054, 83357, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like the balance this image produces in spite of the dishevelled  blankets and rippling textures. The colours all work well together and the lighting is really quite beautiful.</td>', 'I really like the balance this image produces in spite of the dishevelled  blankets and rippling textures. The colours all work well together and the lighting is really quite beautiful.', '2004-06-21 07:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(771060, 83690, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition of this picture makes quite an impact. The bright colours of the flag contrast so well with the more subdued background elements. The motion blur has such an amazing impact on the picture in more ways than one. I love the slight blur on the end of the flag. It just adds that extra bit of life to it.</td>', 'The composition of this picture makes quite an impact. The bright colours of the flag contrast so well with the more subdued background elements. The motion blur has such an amazing impact on the picture in more ways than one. I love the slight blur on the end of the flag. It just adds that extra bit of life to it.', '2004-06-21 07:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(771063, 84019, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition of this image strikes me straight away. Its always so impressive when someone catchs a natural scene with such a visual balance. The reflection on the water really highlights the  tall white bird as does the contrasting textures and tones of the other birds. I think this is a simply beautiful picture.</td>', 'The composition of this image strikes me straight away. Its always so impressive when someone catchs a natural scene with such a visual balance. The reflection on the water really highlights the  tall white bird as does the contrasting textures and tones of the other birds. I think this is a simply beautiful picture.', '2004-06-21 07:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(771065, 83441, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. The feeling of temptation to head down the forbidden road is almost irresistable. The green from the post and the red of the sign are just awesome against the sand tones. The gate cutting across the front adds a quirky element to the image that is in no way out of place. This is an awesome shot.</td>', 'I love this picture. The feeling of temptation to head down the forbidden road is almost irresistable. The green from the post and the red of the sign are just awesome against the sand tones. The gate cutting across the front adds a quirky element to the image that is in no way out of place. This is an awesome shot.', '2004-06-21 07:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
