(771074, 83039, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice in sepia</td>', 'nice in sepia', '2004-06-21 07:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(771075, 83857, 16241, '<td valign="top">you should sell this to coke..... nice &amp; clear, like the purple background tooo</td>', 'you should sell this to coke..... nice & clear, like the purple background tooo', '2004-06-21 07:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(771078, 83733, 22011, '<td valign="top">This is technically a very good image, and the idea is great as well..  The backdrop is a little too close to the model, or possibly could have done with some lighting to bring out the shadows behind him..</td>', 'This is technically a very good image, and the idea is great as well..  The backdrop is a little too close to the model, or possibly could have done with some lighting to bring out the shadows behind him..', '2004-06-21 07:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(771079, 83486, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the steel and the grass. It''s quite dramatic. I think the reflection in the helmet on the right is a little distracting though. The blue tones in the steel really pop out against the grass. I think the composition gives the image a really solid appearance. The more I look at it the more solid it becomes.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the steel and the grass. It''s quite dramatic. I think the reflection in the helmet on the right is a little distracting though. The blue tones in the steel really pop out against the grass. I think the composition gives the image a really solid appearance. The more I look at it the more solid it becomes.', '2004-06-21 07:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(771083, 83423, 22011, '<td valign="top">Great shallow DOF, although the in focus item looks a little soft, and the highlights on the rear tubes are distracting it''s otherwise brilliant.</td>', 'Great shallow DOF, although the in focus item looks a little soft, and the highlights on the rear tubes are distracting it''s otherwise brilliant.', '2004-06-21 07:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(771085, 83891, 22011, '<td valign="top">Choices?</td>', 'Choices?', '2004-06-21 07:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(771088, 83868, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the way that this shot could be either a deliberately composed subject or a candid shot of a real world subject. It gives the image a quirky quality that really adds to it. The multi-coloured, soft textures contrast with the solid, smooth wood creating a vibrant and almost energetic image. The only thing I would change would be to try and get the edges of the box evenly around the image.</td>', 'I love the way that this shot could be either a deliberately composed subject or a candid shot of a real world subject. It gives the image a quirky quality that really adds to it. The multi-coloured, soft textures contrast with the solid, smooth wood creating a vibrant and almost energetic image. The only thing I would change would be to try and get the edges of the box evenly around the image.', '2004-06-21 07:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(771092, 83694, 22011, '<td valign="top">This is a well captured shot, but I''m not sure how it fits the challenge? He chose to stop the horse?  I chose to wear that hat?</td>', 'This is a well captured shot, but I''m not sure how it fits the challenge? He chose to stop the horse?  I chose to wear that hat?', '2004-06-21 07:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(771095, 82917, 22011, '<td valign="top">Insurance or food?  I find the flash highlight on the spoon is really distracting....</td>', 'Insurance or food?  I find the flash highlight on the spoon is really distracting....', '2004-06-21 07:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(771098, 83783, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the diffused light in this image. Also the way that one chair is in the light and one in the dark. There''s an etheral sense about the image that makes the choice of where to sit seem more important than perhaps it is. I think this image fits the theme of the challenge in such a sublime way. Its a really beautiful image. My only suggestion would be that cropping some of the woodwork off the top could shift more of the emphasise to the seats.</td>', 'I love the diffused light in this image. Also the way that one chair is in the light and one in the dark. There''s an etheral sense about the image that makes the choice of where to sit seem more important than perhaps it is. I think this image fits the theme of the challenge in such a sublime way. Its a really beautiful image. My only suggestion would be that cropping some of the woodwork off the top could shift more of the emphasise to the seats.', '2004-06-21 07:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(771103, 84013, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a great picture! If you don''t ribbon for this, then the world is just not fair. :-)</td>', 'Wow - what a great picture! If you don''t ribbon for this, then the world is just not fair. :-)', '2004-06-21 07:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(771106, 83736, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of light in this image. The harsh light and lack of shadows emphasizes the only difference between the types of pasta: The Shape. My only suggestion would be that you could really go to town on the placement making it more formal and evenly spaced to really emphasize the lighting and composition. It is really powerful how you have made such a stark impact with such an everyday subject matter.</td>', 'I really like the use of light in this image. The harsh light and lack of shadows emphasizes the only difference between the types of pasta: The Shape. My only suggestion would be that you could really go to town on the placement making it more formal and evenly spaced to really emphasize the lighting and composition. It is really powerful how you have made such a stark impact with such an everyday subject matter.', '2004-06-21 08:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(771110, 83903, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the character of this image. Its a rather candid shot that has quite a bit of impact. The lighting goes a long way towards producing the atmosphere. I love these kind of candid shots</td>', 'I like the character of this image. Its a rather candid shot that has quite a bit of impact. The lighting goes a long way towards producing the atmosphere. I love these kind of candid shots', '2004-06-21 08:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(771114, 83394, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot. The centrally placed black and white crayons epitomizes the basic choice. I like the way that a fundamental principle like basic choice is embedded into such an everyday subject. I think your choice to include the entire subject matter in the depth of field was a really good idea.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot. The centrally placed black and white crayons epitomizes the basic choice. I like the way that a fundamental principle like basic choice is embedded into such an everyday subject. I think your choice to include the entire subject matter in the depth of field was a really good idea.', '2004-06-21 08:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(771120, 83811, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the stone and the delicacy of the petals. The depth of field is spot on. This is a truly beautiful image. I''m not sure how it fits with the theme of choices. It is a beautiful image though.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the stone and the delicacy of the petals. The depth of field is spot on. This is a truly beautiful image. I''m not sure how it fits with the theme of choices. It is a beautiful image though.', '2004-06-21 08:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(771125, 83778, 23300, '<td valign="top">Its quirky how the units labelled "Brown''s" are both green and the one that''s actually brown is not labelled at all. I like the simplicity of this shot.</td>', 'Its quirky how the units labelled "Brown''s" are both green and the one that''s actually brown is not labelled at all. I like the simplicity of this shot.', '2004-06-21 08:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(771131, 83776, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicty of this image. I think if the backgroud material was a little tidier it would emphasize the rings more. The colour works well though. Also the focus could maybe be a little sharper.</td>', 'I like the simplicty of this image. I think if the backgroud material was a little tidier it would emphasize the rings more. The colour works well though. Also the focus could maybe be a little sharper.', '2004-06-21 08:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(771135, 84063, 23300, '<td valign="top">The sheer colour impact of this image is startling. I love the impact of the depth of field.</td>', 'The sheer colour impact of this image is startling. I love the impact of the depth of field.', '2004-06-21 08:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(771139, 83882, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the sense of abundance created by this image. The baskets brake up the image really well and a bit of life.</td>', 'I love the sense of abundance created by this image. The baskets brake up the image really well and a bit of life.', '2004-06-21 08:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(771144, 83779, 23300, '<td valign="top">Love the impact of the colour and the depth of field. The cropping is quite powerful as it makes the apple look really deep.</td>', 'Love the impact of the colour and the depth of field. The cropping is quite powerful as it makes the apple look really deep.', '2004-06-21 08:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(771151, 83438, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image is quite compelling. I want to grab the camera myself. I love the lighting coming through the window and the way it contrasts with the red wall. Awesome.</td>', 'This image is quite compelling. I want to grab the camera myself. I love the lighting coming through the window and the way it contrasts with the red wall. Awesome.', '2004-06-21 08:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(771154, 83794, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the vibrant screen colours and the lighting in the rest of the image. The silver tones in the image are really beautiful.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the vibrant screen colours and the lighting in the rest of the image. The silver tones in the image are really beautiful.', '2004-06-21 08:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(771155, 83649, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this image is very powerful. I love the shadows in the foreground. The subtle tones in the sky really add a sense of depth as well.</td>', 'The lighting in this image is very powerful. I love the shadows in the foreground. The subtle tones in the sky really add a sense of depth as well.', '2004-06-21 08:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(771157, 83927, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the sureal effect created by the textures and lighting. The composition is also quite compelling. I think this is a subtle and beautiful image.</td>', 'I like the sureal effect created by the textures and lighting. The composition is also quite compelling. I think this is a subtle and beautiful image.', '2004-06-21 08:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(771158, 84011, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great use of depth of field. It really adds a sense of volume.</td>', 'Great use of depth of field. It really adds a sense of volume.', '2004-06-21 08:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(771160, 84051, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the composition. The pole on the right just finishes it off.</td>', 'I love the composition. The pole on the right just finishes it off.', '2004-06-21 08:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(771169, 83754, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition of this image is awesome. The composition, the cropping,  the lighting. Its got a real pro look.</td>', 'The composition of this image is awesome. The composition, the cropping,  the lighting. Its got a real pro look.', '2004-06-21 08:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(771174, 83962, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the light in this image. The darkness of the subject really emphasizes his isolation against the light background. There''s a real sense of desolation and aloneness, even vulnerability. The detail in the foreground contrasts so well with the soft distant background. This is a beautiful and provocative image.</td>', 'I love the light in this image. The darkness of the subject really emphasizes his isolation against the light background. There''s a real sense of desolation and aloneness, even vulnerability. The detail in the foreground contrasts so well with the soft distant background. This is a beautiful and provocative image.', '2004-06-21 08:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(771180, 83810, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the slow shutter speed has been utilized really well for this subject. It doesn''t just look like a single motion. It could easily represent indecision or a number of movements.</td>', 'I think the slow shutter speed has been utilized really well for this subject. It doesn''t just look like a single motion. It could easily represent indecision or a number of movements.', '2004-06-21 08:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(771186, 83739, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the ominous nature of this image. As if a lot is dependent on the outcome. The mood is quite dramatic. The soft focus adds to the drama.</td>', 'I like the ominous nature of this image. As if a lot is dependent on the outcome. The mood is quite dramatic. The soft focus adds to the drama.', '2004-06-21 08:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(771190, 83579, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image really generates the feeling of pondering about options. The composition is beautiful and the colours speak for themselves</td>', 'This image really generates the feeling of pondering about options. The composition is beautiful and the colours speak for themselves', '2004-06-21 09:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(771239, 83441, 1202, '<td valign="top">The road just beckons me to want to hop the fence so I can see around the bend.   It might be a little overexposed, but then again dry grass is difficult.  Good job.</td>', 'The road just beckons me to want to hop the fence so I can see around the bend.   It might be a little overexposed, but then again dry grass is difficult.  Good job.', '2004-06-21 10:09:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(771268, 83579, 2464, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.. I just hope he didn''t jump.... 9</td>', 'This is a great shot.. I just hope he didn''t jump.... 9', '2004-06-21 10:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(771272, 84019, 2464, '<td valign="top">I love the shot of the birds but it''s a bit out of focus. I''m no expert but I think if the shot was made to include all the 4 birds with framing the shot a little to the left will take away the dead space on the right, also the duckling looks a bit tad to dark. 6</td>', 'I love the shot of the birds but it''s a bit out of focus. I''m no expert but I think if the shot was made to include all the 4 birds with framing the shot a little to the left will take away the dead space on the right, also the duckling looks a bit tad to dark. 6', '2004-06-21 10:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(771274, 84028, 2464, '<td valign="top">Don''t we all need it.. hahaha...</td>', 'Don''t we all need it.. hahaha...', '2004-06-21 10:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(771284, 83277, 2464, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!! Love the detail and but would be better if you were placing the 11 in the middle of the shot...8</td>', 'Great shot!!! Love the detail and but would be better if you were placing the 11 in the middle of the shot...8', '2004-06-21 11:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(771287, 83920, 2464, '<td valign="top">Great stuff, I think one where most people can relate to... 8</td>', 'Great stuff, I think one where most people can relate to... 8', '2004-06-21 11:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(771291, 82696, 2464, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been nice to see this in colour..6</td>', 'I think it would have been nice to see this in colour..6', '2004-06-21 11:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(771399, 83355, 22825, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a blush:-)  I like the shadows.  Nice shot: 7.</td>', 'Looks more like a blush:-)  I like the shadows.  Nice shot: 7.', '2004-06-21 12:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(771403, 84011, 22825, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2004-06-21 12:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(771405, 83423, 7560, '<td valign="top">I usually like shallow DOF. I''m going through a shallow dof phase. :) In this image, I''m not totally sure if it helps or not.  The light source on the paint tubes feels overly harsh, and leads to reflections that are distracting on the blue background. I''m also wondering if part of the problem might just be color choice? The image feels harshly lit, and the white being the only  infocus element enforces that feeling.  I might consider diffusing the light source with a piece of paper to soften the light and move the red or orange to be the infocus color. (assuming you are trying to get a shallow DOF shot.) 5</td>', 'I usually like shallow DOF. I''m going through a shallow dof phase. :) In this image, I''m not totally sure if it helps or not.  The light source on the paint tubes feels overly harsh, and leads to reflections that are distracting on the blue background. I''m also wondering if part of the problem might just be color choice? The image feels harshly lit, and the white being the only  infocus element enforces that feeling.  I might consider diffusing the light source with a piece of paper to soften the light and move the red or orange to be the infocus color. (assuming you are trying to get a shallow DOF shot.) 5', '2004-06-21 12:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(771408, 84060, 22825, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and shot.  I might have left a little more on top in the crop, if possible.  7</td>', 'Nice idea and shot.  I might have left a little more on top in the crop, if possible.  7', '2004-06-21 12:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(771410, 83866, 22825, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  It looks like it could use a bit sharper focus.</td>', 'Nice idea.  It looks like it could use a bit sharper focus.', '2004-06-21 12:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(771412, 83607, 22825, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and depth of field.</td>', 'I like the perspective and depth of field.', '2004-06-21 12:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(771416, 83511, 22825, '<td valign="top">Really nice photograph, and I like the soft depth of field.  My only suggestion is that I might have focused on the foremost crayon and changed the perspective just a touch to give it more weight in the photo.  8</td>', 'Really nice photograph, and I like the soft depth of field.  My only suggestion is that I might have focused on the foremost crayon and changed the perspective just a touch to give it more weight in the photo.  8', '2004-06-21 12:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(771419, 83802, 22825, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph, but the image itself doesn''t really depict the choice.</td>', 'Nice photograph, but the image itself doesn''t really depict the choice.', '2004-06-21 12:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(771470, 82820, 23308, '<td valign="top">Nice Photo, and a question ''some" would ask if this close. Me I would keep a safe distance.</td>', 'Nice Photo, and a question ''some" would ask if this close. Me I would keep a safe distance.', '2004-06-21 13:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
