(771592, 83810, 21478, '<td valign="top">I really liked the way this is put together. I certainly feel the "hesitation/choice" of putting the brake on. I hope you were parked when you took this!</td>', 'I really liked the way this is put together. I certainly feel the "hesitation/choice" of putting the brake on. I hope you were parked when you took this!', '2004-06-21 14:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
