(772469, 83694, 12252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job, should be heading for a ribbon. Kind of a stretch (for me) in terms of meeting the challenge, but I found an argument, so I won''t ding you for that. The photo itself is top notch. Love that expression on the guy''s face, and love how the sand is kicking up. Very, very nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful job, should be heading for a ribbon. Kind of a stretch (for me) in terms of meeting the challenge, but I found an argument, so I won''t ding you for that. The photo itself is top notch. Love that expression on the guy''s face, and love how the sand is kicking up. Very, very nice job.', '2004-06-21 23:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(772470, 83177, 12252, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge, and the image itself isn''t very compelling.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge, and the image itself isn''t very compelling.', '2004-06-21 23:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
