(772477, 83208, 12252, '<td valign="top">First of all, way too small. Second, way too busy -- too many things to try to focus on. Third, I think your title was supposed to be Want To Do''s, right? Anyway, had to mark way down for size and busy composition. Idea itself was clever and I''d try again, if I were you</td>', 'First of all, way too small. Second, way too busy -- too many things to try to focus on. Third, I think your title was supposed to be Want To Do''s, right? Anyway, had to mark way down for size and busy composition. Idea itself was clever and I''d try again, if I were you', '2004-06-21 23:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(772478, 83333, 12252, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really illustrate CHOICE, to me. Seems like a cut-and-dried suicide pic, if there is such a thing. In other words, he doesn''t look like he''s still debating the choice. His mind is made up. Anyway, background blends too much with the subject (where are his eyes and arms and such?) Seems out of focus as well</td>', 'Doesn''t really illustrate CHOICE, to me. Seems like a cut-and-dried suicide pic, if there is such a thing. In other words, he doesn''t look like he''s still debating the choice. His mind is made up. Anyway, background blends too much with the subject (where are his eyes and arms and such?) Seems out of focus as well', '2004-06-21 23:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(772480, 82795, 12252, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what you''re going for with this picture. In any event, the background is distracting, the milk (?? is blown out, and the composition isn''t terribly compelling. Beats me how this meets the challenge.</td>', 'I have no idea what you''re going for with this picture. In any event, the background is distracting, the milk (?? is blown out, and the composition isn''t terribly compelling. Beats me how this meets the challenge.', '2004-06-21 23:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
