(772489, 83935, 12252, '<td valign="top">This would have scored higher if it were larger. It''s a good, if somewhat overdone, idea. The black marker is lost in the background, btw. The composition isn''t that creative, however. Maybe movei t off center and have less negative space. Just a thought!</td>', 'This would have scored higher if it were larger. It''s a good, if somewhat overdone, idea. The black marker is lost in the background, btw. The composition isn''t that creative, however. Maybe movei t off center and have less negative space. Just a thought!', '2004-06-21 23:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(772490, 83802, 12252, '<td valign="top">Not, is the answer. Sorry, doesn''t appear to meet the challenge to me. Rather dark as well. Good points are the focus, and interesting position of the bird. But it doesn''t meet this challenge.</td>', 'Not, is the answer. Sorry, doesn''t appear to meet the challenge to me. Rather dark as well. Good points are the focus, and interesting position of the bird. But it doesn''t meet this challenge.', '2004-06-21 23:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
