(773383, 83906, 22990, '<td valign="top">Great use of selective desaturation. The only quibbles I have are that the keys are a little too bulky (do they have to reach all the way around the base?), that the liquid no longer has a definite ''edge'' to it and that the lighting is a little bit harsh. Otherwise, nicely done.</td>', 'Great use of selective desaturation. The only quibbles I have are that the keys are a little too bulky (do they have to reach all the way around the base?), that the liquid no longer has a definite ''edge'' to it and that the lighting is a little bit harsh. Otherwise, nicely done.', '2004-06-22 13:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
