(773884, 83277, 16004, '<td valign="top">Total class and a gorgeous image.  i''m trying to stop leaving comments on BEAUTIFUL pictures upon which i can''t offer any sort of constructive comment, but dang it, i can''t help it.  this is wonderful.  pictures of cameras don''t normally get me excited (a bit too much unoriginality and seemingly lack of thought to me) but this is a true exception.  focus, shades, angle, EVERYthing is just perfect.  a remarkable shot, and one of my top 3.  10</td>', 'Total class and a gorgeous image.  i''m trying to stop leaving comments on BEAUTIFUL pictures upon which i can''t offer any sort of constructive comment, but dang it, i can''t help it.  this is wonderful.  pictures of cameras don''t normally get me excited (a bit too much unoriginality and seemingly lack of thought to me) but this is a true exception.  focus, shades, angle, EVERYthing is just perfect.  a remarkable shot, and one of my top 3.  10', '2004-06-22 18:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(773891, 82970, 16004, '<td valign="top">well, this is the best coin tossing shot (totally blasts mine).  HOW you got such a great shot with the coin in flight will have me scratching my head for yonks.  i hope you tell.  i like this muchly, though the one thing i''d add is that the hand looks a bit yellow / orange to me - perhaps the lighting is a little harsh?  still, very good shot!   9.</td>', 'well, this is the best coin tossing shot (totally blasts mine).  HOW you got such a great shot with the coin in flight will have me scratching my head for yonks.  i hope you tell.  i like this muchly, though the one thing i''d add is that the hand looks a bit yellow / orange to me - perhaps the lighting is a little harsh?  still, very good shot!   9.', '2004-06-22 18:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(773912, 83068, 16106, '<td valign="top">while it is in my top three I think this could have used a bit more DOF and a bit more hand in the frame. Never the less great idea, well executed.</td>', 'while it is in my top three I think this could have used a bit more DOF and a bit more hand in the frame. Never the less great idea, well executed.', '2004-06-22 19:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(773913, 83882, 16106, '<td valign="top">Top three, just a great shot. Im sure you will get comments that it doesn''t fit the challenge, but IMHO it does quite well and it creates an arresting shot with great geometry.</td>', 'Top three, just a great shot. Im sure you will get comments that it doesn''t fit the challenge, but IMHO it does quite well and it creates an arresting shot with great geometry.', '2004-06-22 19:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(773917, 83733, 16106, '<td valign="top">Colors are a bit flat, and the suit jacket rides a bit too far to the left. However this is still my favorite in the challenge, great choice of subject, well executed. If you had gotten rid of the blue in the laptop or used it again in the uniformor as the batting glove it could have been a bit better balanced, but a very good shot anyway.</td>', 'Colors are a bit flat, and the suit jacket rides a bit too far to the left. However this is still my favorite in the challenge, great choice of subject, well executed. If you had gotten rid of the blue in the laptop or used it again in the uniformor as the batting glove it could have been a bit better balanced, but a very good shot anyway.', '2004-06-22 19:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(773925, 83211, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good technicals (exposure, composition, focus.)  The red works very well with the brick and the black background.  I think a little later lighting may have given some better shadows.  The thin line on the left edge is somewhat annoying but could easliy be cropped out.<br/> <br/>Overall - I''d say in the top 20.  Good job.</td>', 'Good technicals (exposure, composition, focus.)  The red works very well with the brick and the black background.  I think a little later lighting may have given some better shadows.  The thin line on the left edge is somewhat annoying but could easliy be cropped out. Overall - I''d say in the top 20.  Good job.', '2004-06-22 19:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(773930, 83810, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of a long shutter speed (or perhaps rear curtain flash sync.)  Exposure, composition and focus spot on.  Minor problems are the whit dot in front of the pants and at the top of the accelerator.  Black border is pretty "heavy."<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wonderful use of a long shutter speed (or perhaps rear curtain flash sync.)  Exposure, composition and focus spot on.  Minor problems are the whit dot in front of the pants and at the top of the accelerator.  Black border is pretty "heavy." ', '2004-06-22 19:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(773937, 84060, 19608, '<td valign="top">The ole'' "fork in the road" is becoming a DPC cliche!  Nice composition and exposure, but the print seems pretty flat.  It has a lot of midtones but no really white or black tomes.  Since the whitest part of the image is in your border - it detracts a bit.</td>', 'The ole'' "fork in the road" is becoming a DPC cliche!  Nice composition and exposure, but the print seems pretty flat.  It has a lot of midtones but no really white or black tomes.  Since the whitest part of the image is in your border - it detracts a bit.', '2004-06-22 19:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(773942, 83649, 5358, '<td valign="top">Infrared!  The recent challenges are against us.  Selective desat, newsprint, color portrait.  Anyways, nice shot and a great take on the challenge.</td>', 'Infrared!  The recent challenges are against us.  Selective desat, newsprint, color portrait.  Anyways, nice shot and a great take on the challenge.', '2004-06-22 19:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(773946, 83751, 19608, '<td valign="top">Unusual angle - with nice colors.  The white over-exposed ares on the top left are a bit distracting.  Compositionally, it would be a bit better without the tiny triangle in the top right corner.  Overall - a good image that doesn''t shout "choices" without your title.</td>', 'Unusual angle - with nice colors.  The white over-exposed ares on the top left are a bit distracting.  Compositionally, it would be a bit better without the tiny triangle in the top right corner.  Overall - a good image that doesn''t shout "choices" without your title.', '2004-06-22 19:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(773954, 83945, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is a classic example of a snapshot with potential. :) Couple of things to consider here. First is, what''s the most interesting part of the shot? Answer is the expression on baby''s face. We can''t see it real well due to the placement of the bars. The first thing to do- move to your right. Frame the shot so baby''s face doesn''t have the bar going through it. If that doesn''t work- change your angle. Shoot from behind the bambino. Make the pacifiers the focus. That could make this more than just the typical baby shot. You have a great idea here. Play with it a bit and see how shooting from different angles can make it different. 5</td>', 'This is a classic example of a snapshot with potential. :) Couple of things to consider here. First is, what''s the most interesting part of the shot? Answer is the expression on baby''s face. We can''t see it real well due to the placement of the bars. The first thing to do- move to your right. Frame the shot so baby''s face doesn''t have the bar going through it. If that doesn''t work- change your angle. Shoot from behind the bambino. Make the pacifiers the focus. That could make this more than just the typical baby shot. You have a great idea here. Play with it a bit and see how shooting from different angles can make it different. 5', '2004-06-22 19:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(773956, 83703, 5358, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to get this one.  Great take on the challenge.  Hmmm.  What the hell.  10</td>', 'Took me a minute to get this one.  Great take on the challenge.  Hmmm.  What the hell.  10', '2004-06-22 19:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(773966, 83945, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a good example of young choices!  Great use of DoF with the sharp focus on the little one - don''t need to see thepacifiers that sharp.  For me the border is way too much and not needed.</td>', 'It''s a good example of young choices!  Great use of DoF with the sharp focus on the little one - don''t need to see thepacifiers that sharp.  For me the border is way too much and not needed.', '2004-06-22 19:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(773968, 83920, 19608, '<td valign="top">That''s not a choice!  Eat em both!  Your use of the tape measure is very original - adds impact and also makes the viewer think.  Technical stuff all great (exposure, focus, composition.)</td>', 'That''s not a choice!  Eat em both!  Your use of the tape measure is very original - adds impact and also makes the viewer think.  Technical stuff all great (exposure, focus, composition.)', '2004-06-22 19:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(773972, 83822, 19608, '<td valign="top">A stirring image and an unfortunate choice these days.  It''s a great composition with a model well suited for the job.  Her pose and expression are downright perfect.  My only complaint is that the print seems very flat - there''s no really crisp whites - and little contrast.  If that was your intention - you''ve succeded, but Id like it better with more tonal range.  Overall - should be in the top few...</td>', 'A stirring image and an unfortunate choice these days.  It''s a great composition with a model well suited for the job.  Her pose and expression are downright perfect.  My only complaint is that the print seems very flat - there''s no really crisp whites - and little contrast.  If that was your intention - you''ve succeded, but Id like it better with more tonal range.  Overall - should be in the top few...', '2004-06-22 19:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(773981, 83824, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice abstract pattern - and certainly a tough choice.  Focus, exposure are both perfect.  The diagonal composition works well for this but.... the placement of the bright red flower in the upper right was not a good "chooice."  It is the area of most color contrast and draws the eye there - and out of the image.<br/> <br/>It''s an excellent submission - which one won as the "tie of the day?"</td>', 'A very nice abstract pattern - and certainly a tough choice.  Focus, exposure are both perfect.  The diagonal composition works well for this but.... the placement of the bright red flower in the upper right was not a good "chooice."  It is the area of most color contrast and draws the eye there - and out of the image. It''s an excellent submission - which one won as the "tie of the day?"', '2004-06-22 20:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(773984, 83891, 21724, '<td valign="top">cool pic, but how is this a choice?</td>', 'cool pic, but how is this a choice?', '2004-06-22 20:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(773985, 83274, 15574, '<td valign="top">I voted 2 9''s in this challenge and this is one of them....</td>', 'I voted 2 9''s in this challenge and this is one of them....', '2004-06-22 20:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(773986, 83554, 21724, '<td valign="top">too small!!</td>', 'too small!!', '2004-06-22 20:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(773987, 84030, 19608, '<td valign="top">Aw come on - don''t tell me Adam had supersizes!   The image itself is very nice - effective advertizing.  It''s a little unnerving to have the hands "disconnected"  - but the black backgrould works well anyhow.</td>', 'Aw come on - don''t tell me Adam had supersizes!   The image itself is very nice - effective advertizing.  It''s a little unnerving to have the hands "disconnected"  - but the black backgrould works well anyhow.', '2004-06-22 20:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(773988, 83524, 21724, '<td valign="top">wish the words were in focus so I could understand how this is a choice.. but still a neat picture</td>', 'wish the words were in focus so I could understand how this is a choice.. but still a neat picture', '2004-06-22 20:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(773989, 84036, 15574, '<td valign="top">This might not be perfessionally photographed, but just the idea is so great. I love the facial expressions, and the point of view. I wish i would have seen more creative stuff like this in the challenge. I really got tired seeing shoes!..Good Job!</td>', 'This might not be perfessionally photographed, but just the idea is so great. I love the facial expressions, and the point of view. I wish i would have seen more creative stuff like this in the challenge. I really got tired seeing shoes!..Good Job!', '2004-06-22 20:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(773991, 83736, 21724, '<td valign="top">this would be a really neat stock photo</td>', 'this would be a really neat stock photo', '2004-06-22 20:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(773994, 83773, 21724, '<td valign="top">i absolutely adore this photo, i just wish the food wasn''t so blurry :(</td>', 'i absolutely adore this photo, i just wish the food wasn''t so blurry :(', '2004-06-22 20:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(773996, 83128, 21724, '<td valign="top">kinda dull, would have been better with some deepr hues and more contrast</td>', 'kinda dull, would have been better with some deepr hues and more contrast', '2004-06-22 20:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(773997, 84019, 19608, '<td valign="top">The EGRET!  Much more graceful.  A good black and white - but I don''t particularly like the bird on the left cut in half.  Hope you stayed there a while and shot several more.  The water has a wonderful texture/pattern.</td>', 'The EGRET!  Much more graceful.  A good black and white - but I don''t particularly like the bird on the left cut in half.  Hope you stayed there a while and shot several more.  The water has a wonderful texture/pattern.', '2004-06-22 20:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(773999, 84062, 21724, '<td valign="top">wonderful idea, this is really creative.. it looks like it needs to be rotated to the right just a bit, I kinda get the feeling like the whole thing is about to topple over</td>', 'wonderful idea, this is really creative.. it looks like it needs to be rotated to the right just a bit, I kinda get the feeling like the whole thing is about to topple over', '2004-06-22 20:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(774000, 83868, 21724, '<td valign="top">nice crop</td>', 'nice crop', '2004-06-22 20:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(774002, 83882, 21724, '<td valign="top">absolutely fantastic photo, one of my favorites thus far</td>', 'absolutely fantastic photo, one of my favorites thus far', '2004-06-22 20:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(774005, 83068, 19608, '<td valign="top">YEp - no one will say you didn''t meet the challenge!  I do like the way you''ve handled DoF - but.... think it would be better if the pencil and sharply focused area were at the bottom of the image.  If the picture started off sharp - and then fell off going towards the background, it would work better.  Having so much blurriness right in the forground is distracting to me.  Exposure seems spot on.</td>', 'YEp - no one will say you didn''t meet the challenge!  I do like the way you''ve handled DoF - but.... think it would be better if the pencil and sharply focused area were at the bottom of the image.  If the picture started off sharp - and then fell off going towards the background, it would work better.  Having so much blurriness right in the forground is distracting to me.  Exposure seems spot on.', '2004-06-22 20:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(774008, 83976, 21724, '<td valign="top">i feel like I''ve seen this picture before.. awesome, but it''s just so grainy.. try running through neatimage, maybe?</td>', 'i feel like I''ve seen this picture before.. awesome, but it''s just so grainy.. try running through neatimage, maybe?', '2004-06-22 20:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(774009, 83654, 19608, '<td valign="top">Original idea - and no one else thought of this old "classic."  I wonder if our non-US voters did the same thing as kids?  Colors seem a bit dull or muted - but other than that -it''s a well done and effective submission.</td>', 'Original idea - and no one else thought of this old "classic."  I wonder if our non-US voters did the same thing as kids?  Colors seem a bit dull or muted - but other than that -it''s a well done and effective submission.', '2004-06-22 20:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(774011, 83328, 19608, '<td valign="top">Uhh - straight ahead?   A straight forward choice - well exposed and presented.  I like the hint of blue on the right side of the arrow.  It''s not terrible exciting though.</td>', 'Uhh - straight ahead?   A straight forward choice - well exposed and presented.  I like the hint of blue on the right side of the arrow.  It''s not terrible exciting though.', '2004-06-22 20:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(774012, 84058, 21724, '<td valign="top">i think this would have been cooler if you had cropped out the floor so that it was just the doors.. still neat though, great colors</td>', 'i think this would have been cooler if you had cropped out the floor so that it was just the doors.. still neat though, great colors', '2004-06-22 20:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(774019, 83694, 21724, '<td valign="top">how is this a choice?  i''m not sure I get it</td>', 'how is this a choice?  i''m not sure I get it', '2004-06-22 20:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(774029, 83936, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well - I guess that''s a choice - rather obtuse, but a choice.   Composition is nicely done on a diagonal - but please clean that keyboard!  It''s a wonder it works (if it does.)</td>', 'Well - I guess that''s a choice - rather obtuse, but a choice.   Composition is nicely done on a diagonal - but please clean that keyboard!  It''s a wonder it works (if it does.)', '2004-06-22 20:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(774030, 83974, 20662, '<td valign="top">Like the idea but maybe something more colorful than cauliflower would have more impact in the picture. Broccoli perhaps?</td>', 'Like the idea but maybe something more colorful than cauliflower would have more impact in the picture. Broccoli perhaps?', '2004-06-22 20:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(774032, 82970, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the coin in flight - helping someone make a choice.  Black background is perfect for this.  Exposure and composition right on.  A very minor point is the removal of the whitish spot to the left of the bracelet on the wrist.</td>', 'Nice capture of the coin in flight - helping someone make a choice.  Black background is perfect for this.  Exposure and composition right on.  A very minor point is the removal of the whitish spot to the left of the bracelet on the wrist.', '2004-06-22 20:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(774034, 83074, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the falling dice.  It''s a good idea and demonstrates a way to make a choice. Black border is s bit heavy for me. Exposure right on.</td>', 'Nice capture of the falling dice.  It''s a good idea and demonstrates a way to make a choice. Black border is s bit heavy for me. Exposure right on.', '2004-06-22 20:41:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(774036, 82549, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea - but don''t forget the "other" parties!  Colors are a bit muted - the blue of the flag seems to be very dark.  That causes the donket silhouette to nerge with the flag as there is no (or very little) color separation.  It''s an original idea and works well for this challenge.  I hope our non_US voters recognize the party symbols!</td>', 'It''s a good idea - but don''t forget the "other" parties!  Colors are a bit muted - the blue of the flag seems to be very dark.  That causes the donket silhouette to nerge with the flag as there is no (or very little) color separation.  It''s an original idea and works well for this challenge.  I hope our non_US voters recognize the party symbols!', '2004-06-22 20:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(774037, 83981, 19608, '<td valign="top">Yeah - I remember those commercials!  Good idea - well executed and definitely a choice.  With the white in the wrappers - I believe it would hqave worked better with a very dark background.</td>', 'Yeah - I remember those commercials!  Good idea - well executed and definitely a choice.  With the white in the wrappers - I believe it would hqave worked better with a very dark background.', '2004-06-22 20:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(774042, 83451, 19608, '<td valign="top">It looks yummy and is a great bunch of choices.  I like the flowing yellow/ orange cloth - it has great textures and gives the image a magic feel.  BUt, on the other hand - I do not like the way the cloth interacts with the white areas.  Seems like it would be stronger if the entire base was the cloth.  Exposure seems hot in a few places.  Good submission!</td>', 'It looks yummy and is a great bunch of choices.  I like the flowing yellow/ orange cloth - it has great textures and gives the image a magic feel.  BUt, on the other hand - I do not like the way the cloth interacts with the white areas.  Seems like it would be stronger if the entire base was the cloth.  Exposure seems hot in a few places.  Good submission!', '2004-06-22 20:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(774043, 83973, 19608, '<td valign="top">A good many choices - but not very visually appealing.</td>', 'A good many choices - but not very visually appealing.', '2004-06-22 20:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(774044, 83733, 8860, '<td valign="top">Hey - where''s your collar, you''re fired!!!</td>', 'Hey - where''s your collar, you''re fired!!!', '2004-06-22 20:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(774046, 83882, 8860, '<td valign="top">Fun shot and probably my winner! Most interesting so far and it''s well taken.</td>', 'Fun shot and probably my winner! Most interesting so far and it''s well taken.', '2004-06-22 20:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(774047, 83648, 19608, '<td valign="top">Or move to California where everything is non-smoking!  Nice idea and execution.  I wonder how may won''t "get" the ashtrays on the rear tables.  The thin vertical composition is perfect for the subject - but the tiny triangle top right is a wee bit detracting.</td>', 'Or move to California where everything is non-smoking!  Nice idea and execution.  I wonder how may won''t "get" the ashtrays on the rear tables.  The thin vertical composition is perfect for the subject - but the tiny triangle top right is a wee bit detracting.', '2004-06-22 20:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(774048, 83723, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yes. People don''t like dog poo on the beach!!!</td>', 'Yes. People don''t like dog poo on the beach!!!', '2004-06-22 20:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(774050, 83695, 19608, '<td valign="top">A great many choices - all very colorful!  Nice lighting - by allowing the main socks to be well lit and the background fade into semi-darkness.  Your  title "What''s wrong with black" makes me think of your border!  What''s wrong is that it is too heavy and non needed for me.  I normally don''t subtract points for borders - but I had to think twice on this one.</td>', 'A great many choices - all very colorful!  Nice lighting - by allowing the main socks to be well lit and the background fade into semi-darkness.  Your  title "What''s wrong with black" makes me think of your border!  What''s wrong is that it is too heavy and non needed for me.  I normally don''t subtract points for borders - but I had to think twice on this one.', '2004-06-22 20:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(774052, 84028, 19608, '<td valign="top">That''s no choice - hit the button!  Nice idea - definitely fits the challenge well, but no too visually appealing.</td>', 'That''s no choice - hit the button!  Nice idea - definitely fits the challenge well, but no too visually appealing.', '2004-06-22 20:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(774056, 83648, 8860, '<td valign="top">I reckon this choice is pretty easy - if you smoke, go to the tables with the ash tray and if you don''t, then don''t.</td>', 'I reckon this choice is pretty easy - if you smoke, go to the tables with the ash tray and if you don''t, then don''t.', '2004-06-22 21:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(774057, 83438, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great idea - and nice use of DoF - --The camera in sharp focus works well as you can tell enough of the model with the softness.  What doesn''t work is the terrible light from the window.</td>', 'Great idea - and nice use of DoF - --The camera in sharp focus works well as you can tell enough of the model with the softness.  What doesn''t work is the terrible light from the window.', '2004-06-22 21:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(774058, 83868, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation - and lots of choices.  Exposure seems right on, bringing out excellent colors.</td>', 'Nice presentation - and lots of choices.  Exposure seems right on, bringing out excellent colors.', '2004-06-22 21:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(774061, 83870, 19608, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and diagonal composition.  I don''t know what kind of pills they are so I think I miss what you are telling me. I assume if I take one pill - it''s OK, but more and I''m in trouble.  Red line should probably be more uniform.</td>', 'I like the lighting and diagonal composition.  I don''t know what kind of pills they are so I think I miss what you are telling me. I assume if I take one pill - it''s OK, but more and I''m in trouble.  Red line should probably be more uniform.', '2004-06-22 21:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(774064, 83196, 19608, '<td valign="top">I guess his other choice was not to run?  The top half of the image is very well printed - nice range of tones.  The bottom half shows nearly no detail in the snow, yet the animal seems well exposed.  It looks like there was just too many stops in the specturm that day.  I think you could crop of the left side of the image - taking out the foreground pine tree.  That would put the coyote in line with a crash point and be more effective.</td>', 'I guess his other choice was not to run?  The top half of the image is very well printed - nice range of tones.  The bottom half shows nearly no detail in the snow, yet the animal seems well exposed.  It looks like there was just too many stops in the specturm that day.  I think you could crop of the left side of the image - taking out the foreground pine tree.  That would put the coyote in line with a crash point and be more effective.', '2004-06-22 21:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(774069, 83974, 19608, '<td valign="top">That''s no choice!  Pizza wins every time.  Good idea - definitely meets the challenge.  The on-board flash was not your friend though - cauing hot spots on the plate and even on the pizza.</td>', 'That''s no choice!  Pizza wins every time.  Good idea - definitely meets the challenge.  The on-board flash was not your friend though - cauing hot spots on the plate and even on the pizza.', '2004-06-22 21:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(774072, 83178, 14773, '<td valign="top">Not a great photo, there''s no one subject that creates a balance...</td>', 'Not a great photo, there''s no one subject that creates a balance...', '2004-06-22 21:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(774076, 83297, 19608, '<td valign="top">Looks like good healthy choices too!  Excellent idea.  You''ve tried a high-key approach which worked fairly well - but you need to force some light into the foreground to make it truly effective as high key.</td>', 'Looks like good healthy choices too!  Excellent idea.  You''ve tried a high-key approach which worked fairly well - but you need to force some light into the foreground to make it truly effective as high key.', '2004-06-22 21:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(774077, 83866, 14773, '<td valign="top">sorry, poor quality, out of focus :-(</td>', 'sorry, poor quality, out of focus :-(', '2004-06-22 21:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(774079, 83277, 14773, '<td valign="top">I like the focus and contrast</td>', 'I like the focus and contrast', '2004-06-22 21:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
