(774524, 84005, 7322, '<td valign="top">This does represent a choice. It''s kind of a bizarre way of showing it, IMO. It took me a minute to figure out that the stuff in the bottle is some kind of euthanasia. I could say this would be more effective if you eliminated the distracting background but, honestly, I think this set-up is too contrived to make an appealing photo. It didn''t move me at all, except that the kitten is cute.</td>', 'This does represent a choice. It''s kind of a bizarre way of showing it, IMO. It took me a minute to figure out that the stuff in the bottle is some kind of euthanasia. I could say this would be more effective if you eliminated the distracting background but, honestly, I think this set-up is too contrived to make an appealing photo. It didn''t move me at all, except that the kitten is cute.', '2004-06-23 01:35:13.000000', NULL, 0),
