(775364, 83138, 19035, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Stookesberry:</b></div><hr/><i> What are we choosing - fruit looks the same. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The sign says ''Fresh Choices'', there are three different types of melons in the picture to choose from, this seems pretty obvious to me, what do you think?  I was surprised that so mny people made the choice to give this a ''2'', I was wondering why - if anyone could give some input, that would be great.</td>', 'Originally posted by Stookesberry: What are we choosing - fruit looks the same.   The sign says ''Fresh Choices'', there are three different types of melons in the picture to choose from, this seems pretty obvious to me, what do you think?  I was surprised that so mny people made the choice to give this a ''2'', I was wondering why - if anyone could give some input, that would be great.', '2004-06-23 07:14:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(775367, 83976, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice image ..nice technique. don`t be put off by the negativity David.<br/>Your image has probably suffered from the fact that a lot of voters only give the image 2 or 3 seconds viewing time.. I have been guilty of this myself in the past..but hopefully learned from it :)<br/> <br/>Well done.<br/>Gordon</td>', 'Nice image ..nice technique. don`t be put off by the negativity David.Your image has probably suffered from the fact that a lot of voters only give the image 2 or 3 seconds viewing time.. I have been guilty of this myself in the past..but hopefully learned from it :) Well done.Gordon', '2004-06-23 07:18:33.000000', NULL, 0),
