(776166, 84013, 16106, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the kind words and comments. I knew that this entry was just skirting the challenge limitations, and as a result it was scoring about a 5.5 before it was verified. I know some people don''t care for a gimicky shot like this, but I''m guessing  some voters scored it low because they thougt it was in violation of the basic editing rules. That said I am quite pleased with a top ten finish and pleased that my three favorites are all in the top ten as well.<br/> <br/>Beagleboy, I used capture one''s white balance and the color looked fine on my monitor, but since it is early in the summer swim season her hair shouldn''t be green yet. I looked on my wife''s monitor, and ya I see your point. Looks like a new monitor will be needed, but would really rather spend any spare cash on some L glass.<br/> <br/>Photom and Jesuispeure, both comments are quite right and were dealt with as far as possible in the "corrected and illegal" version that I have printed out for her grandmother for whom this was really intended.<br/> <br/>If you don''t understand how I got this shot and would like to see the setup from a step or two backward. it becomes easier to see. <a href="//www.pbase.com/image/30249691" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pbase.com/image/30249691</a> <br/>    Brennan<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the kind words and comments. I knew that this entry was just skirting the challenge limitations, and as a result it was scoring about a 5.5 before it was verified. I know some people don''t care for a gimicky shot like this, but I''m guessing  some voters scored it low because they thougt it was in violation of the basic editing rules. That said I am quite pleased with a top ten finish and pleased that my three favorites are all in the top ten as well. Beagleboy, I used capture one''s white balance and the color looked fine on my monitor, but since it is early in the summer swim season her hair shouldn''t be green yet. I looked on my wife''s monitor, and ya I see your point. Looks like a new monitor will be needed, but would really rather spend any spare cash on some L glass. Photom and Jesuispeure, both comments are quite right and were dealt with as far as possible in the "corrected and illegal" version that I have printed out for her grandmother for whom this was really intended. If you don''t understand how I got this shot and would like to see the setup from a step or two backward. it becomes easier to see. //www.pbase.com/image/30249691     Brennan ', '2004-06-23 14:45:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(776226, 83970, 14043, '<td valign="top">What the heck, I understood your photo...  -_-  I don''t get it, what happened in this challenge?  This is a great photo that should have done much better!  It especially didn''t deserve 10 1s and 14 2s.<br/> <br/>Your use of negative space/clouds &amp; sky really draws your eye to the sign (not to mention with the red of the sign as you said).  And there is nothing BAD about it at all!</td>', 'What the heck, I understood your photo...  -_-  I don''t get it, what happened in this challenge?  This is a great photo that should have done much better!  It especially didn''t deserve 10 1s and 14 2s. Your use of negative space/clouds & sky really draws your eye to the sign (not to mention with the red of the sign as you said).  And there is nothing BAD about it at all!', '2004-06-23 15:18:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(776231, 84034, 20330, '<td valign="top">Thank you all so much for your votes and comments. I do want to thank my boys for modeling for me, it was raining on and off that day and they stuck it out for about an hour :) I am so pleased to make top ten since I just got into photography back in January ''04. I am obsessed now! Special thanks (and welcome to DPC) to Tikitom who, over the past months, has helped me learn about my camera and has given me unwavering support! This has turned into an acceptance speech LOL so I''ll close with, THANKS!!!<br/> <br/>*however, that 1 vote of 1 is bugging the crap out of me. why did this person think I deserved a 1?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-23 14:22:37.</i></td>', 'Thank you all so much for your votes and comments. I do want to thank my boys for modeling for me, it was raining on and off that day and they stuck it out for about an hour :) I am so pleased to make top ten since I just got into photography back in January ''04. I am obsessed now! Special thanks (and welcome to DPC) to Tikitom who, over the past months, has helped me learn about my camera and has given me unwavering support! This has turned into an acceptance speech LOL so I''ll close with, THANKS!!! *however, that 1 vote of 1 is bugging the crap out of me. why did this person think I deserved a 1?', '2004-06-23 15:21:16.000000', '2004-06-23 15:22:37.000000', 0),
