(777589, 83733, 9913, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by abreul:</b></div><hr/><i> Can some please tell how or why his picture is the winner? I give this a 1 and is not even showing I read some of the comments but they dont really make sense. Are this contest more like Title contest or pictures contest? I have to Admit a title is important for any composition but please...c''mon this pic got nothing to me. but anyway I have to congratulate aaron532 for the ribbon... work pays.<br/>Things I notice:<br/>Poor Background<br/>The model should it have a half of a baseball hat to complete the idea.<br/>I saw this kind of idea on different pics a TV comercial is not very original. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>How come the graph sais it has ZERO 1´s then?</td>', 'Originally posted by abreul: Can some please tell how or why his picture is the winner? I give this a 1 and is not even showing I read some of the comments but they dont really make sense. Are this contest more like Title contest or pictures contest? I have to Admit a title is important for any composition but please...c''mon this pic got nothing to me. but anyway I have to congratulate aaron532 for the ribbon... work pays.Things I notice:Poor BackgroundThe model should it have a half of a baseball hat to complete the idea.I saw this kind of idea on different pics a TV comercial is not very original.   How come the graph sais it has ZERO 1´s then?', '2004-06-24 05:41:27.000000', NULL, 0),
