(778236, 83882, 22545, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! :)</td>', 'Congratulations! :)', '2004-06-24 16:28:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(778409, 83733, 20494, '<td valign="top">I kinda like this photo alot! I''m one of those 32 voters that gave a 10! photo composition and lighting were excellent....the idea were great too! i mean...it project a person having to choose between his dream and career (or reality i would say!) which some of us have encounter.....having to sacrifice your dream and aspiration and pursue a "stable (sometime boring) career"!! Once again, congratulation.....you deserved the ribbon! :)</td>', 'I kinda like this photo alot! I''m one of those 32 voters that gave a 10! photo composition and lighting were excellent....the idea were great too! i mean...it project a person having to choose between his dream and career (or reality i would say!) which some of us have encounter.....having to sacrifice your dream and aspiration and pursue a "stable (sometime boring) career"!! Once again, congratulation.....you deserved the ribbon! :)', '2004-06-24 19:34:51.000000', NULL, 0),
