(1591340, 83554, 24183, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have alot of comments saying this is too small, but no one told you how to fix this.  Alway make you photo as large a possible, if you are using photoshop ethier resize the image by changing the largest number to 640px, then when you save your image reduce the quality of the image until the size in close to 150kb but do not go over this size or dpchallene will not allow you to enter the photo.  If you need more help feel free to PM me.<br/> <br/>travis</td>', 'Looks like you have alot of comments saying this is too small, but no one told you how to fix this.  Alway make you photo as large a possible, if you are using photoshop ethier resize the image by changing the largest number to 640px, then when you save your image reduce the quality of the image until the size in close to 150kb but do not go over this size or dpchallene will not allow you to enter the photo.  If you need more help feel free to PM me. travis', '2005-08-06 21:02:01.000000', NULL, 0),
